{
  "__comment__": "API 格式样例：UC int8 safetensors 基模版，由 workflow.py build() 生成，可直接 POST /prompt（需先把 refs 里的 3 张图上传到 ComfyUI 的 input 目录）。GGUF 版见 api_workflow_turbo_gguf_example.json 与 api_workflow_uc_q4_gguf_example.json。App 运行时会动态生成同结构 JSON。",
  "output_node_id": "32",
  "prompt": {
    "1": {
      "class_type": "UNETLoader",
      "inputs": {
        "unet_name": "qwen-image-2.1-UC-int8_convrot.safetensors",
        "weight_dtype": "default"
      }
    },
    "2": {
      "class_type": "QwenImage21Cache",
      "inputs": {
        "model": [
          "1",
          0
        ],
        "device": "auto",
        "dtype": "default"
      }
    },
    "3": {
      "class_type": "CLIPLoader",
      "inputs": {
        "clip_name": "qwen_image_2.1\\qwen3-vl-8b-heretic-1.3.0-int8convrot.safetensors",
        "type": "qwen_image",
        "device": "default"
      }
    },
    "4": {
      "class_type": "VAELoader",
      "inputs": {
        "vae_name": "qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors"
      }
    },
    "10": {
      "class_type": "LoadImage",
      "inputs": {
        "image": "pws_person_example.png"
      }
    },
    "11": {
      "class_type": "LoadImage",
      "inputs": {
        "image": "pws_costume_example.png"
      }
    },
    "12": {
      "class_type": "LoadImage",
      "inputs": {
        "image": "pws_pose_example.png"
      }
    },
    "20": {
      "class_type": "TextEncodeQwenImage21",
      "inputs": {
        "clip": [
          "3",
          0
        ],
        "vae": [
          "4",
          0
        ],
        "prompt": "以 <image1> 中的成年女性为主角，严格保持她的面部特征、五官、发型发色、肤色与体型不变，生成一张自然写实的人像摄影照片。\n让她换上 <image2> 中展示的整套服装，精确还原款式、颜色、图案、面料质感与搭配（white shirt, black shorts）。\n让她的身体姿势、四肢位置、身体朝向与镜头角度完全参照 <image3>：seated leaning back，front视角。\n根据输出画幅合理构图，人物完整入画、手清晰可见、不裁切头脚，光线自然柔和，背景简洁干净，真实皮肤质感，高细节、高清晰度，专业人像摄影，无文字无水印。",
        "negative_prompt": "服装错乱，姿势不符，多个人物，多余肢体，畸形的手指，面部变形，身份不一致，低分辨率，模糊，过曝，卡通，插画，3D 渲染，文字，水印，logo，边框",
        "resolution": 1024,
        "images.image_1": [
          "10",
          0
        ],
        "images.image_2": [
          "11",
          0
        ],
        "images.image_3": [
          "12",
          0
        ]
      }
    },
    "21": {
      "class_type": "EmptyLatentImage",
      "inputs": {
        "width": 1344,
        "height": 1792,
        "batch_size": 1
      }
    },
    "30": {
      "class_type": "KSampler",
      "inputs": {
        "model": [
          "2",
          0
        ],
        "seed": 12345,
        "steps": 25,
        "cfg": 1.0,
        "sampler_name": "euler",
        "scheduler": "simple",
        "positive": [
          "20",
          0
        ],
        "negative": [
          "20",
          1
        ],
        "latent_image": [
          "21",
          0
        ],
        "denoise": 1.0
      }
    },
    "31": {
      "class_type": "VAEDecode",
      "inputs": {
        "samples": [
          "30",
          0
        ],
        "vae": [
          "4",
          0
        ]
      }
    },
    "32": {
      "class_type": "SaveImage",
      "inputs": {
        "images": [
          "31",
          0
        ],
        "filename_prefix": "PoseWearStudio/example"
      }
    }
  }
}